# Convergence — F0 decision preparation

AC-01..04: APPROVED for documentary preparation only. The current criterion-specific
review is docs/validation/f0-reconciliation-20261101/decision-preparation/review.md;
input versions, comparisons, negative controls and checks accompany it. The previous
convergence and full evidence envelope remain in decision-preparation/before/.
Earlier reconciliation of nine T004 tasks and recovery-helper changes is unchanged;
its historical 46-test/439-input results are not reported as new execution.

T007..T009 completed the current diagnostic, common experiment protocol and affected
document review. T006 remains a maintainer decision. F0 is open: four INCONCLUSIVE
and three UNVERIFIED rows. The immediate decision blocker and incomplete operational
coverage are separate; it is not established that new foundation code is needed.
The missing durable-history implementation belongs to the proposed independent
post-F0/pre-MVP feature. The maintainer has not yet adopted that assignment.

Current read-only comparison: 38 product observations, 3,514 declared input/artifact
bindings, zero mismatches. Current structure check and eight binding tests passed;
the old F0 envelope was correctly rejected for changed document inputs before this
successor review. Final link/freshness results are in checks-final.json. No Cargo,
GUI, persistence experiment or new product acceptance is claimed.

The ADR now prohibits technology selection before paired results, removes the old
leading-candidate preference and direct-selection shortcut, and separates experiment
permission from integration authorization. product-local-persistence AC-01..07 remain
UNVERIFIED. Resume with F0-D1..D4 adoption, then G2 criterion coverage; any storage
prototype requires its own D3/D4 grant, and selection/integration require D5/D6.
